    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "images": [
            {
              "position": "right",
              "src": "/assets/images/extras/audiobooks/starter/young-learners-adults/who-wants-to-be-a-star/paragraph-11.avif",
              "alt": "Paragraph 11 image"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Mrs. White and Tina look at the fox’s work. The chickens are making a terrible noise. “We can’t have eggs for breakfast morning, Tina,” says Mrs. White. “Why not?” asks Tina. “The chickens aren’t very happy. When they aren’t happy they can’t give us eggs.” Mrs. White explains. For breakfast, Tina has toast and fresh orange juice."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
