    {
      "text": [
        {
          "images": [
            {
              "position": "right",
              "src": "/assets/images/extras/audiobooks/starter/young-learners-adults/who-wants-to-be-a-star/paragraph-12.avif",
              "alt": "Paragraph 12 image"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Three days later Tina is with Bella, the horse. She loves Bella and gives her some sugar. Today the postman has a letter from Mrs. White. When he sees Tina, he says, “I don’t believe it—it’s Curls!” Then he says to her, “Everyone’s looking for you. You’re in all the newspapers!” He runs to his red van to find his newspaper."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
